{% comment %}
  ==================================================================
  GS PRODUCT COUNTDOWN
  Ported from gs-shopify-v3 snippets/product-countdown.liquid
  ==================================================================
  USAGE:
    {% raw %}{% render 'gs-product-countdown', cardProduct: product %}{% endraw %}

  Reads the product metafield theme.product_countdown. The numbers are
  populated client-side by the countdown script.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  BUG FIXED: SINGULAR/PLURAL DERIVED FROM THE WRONG NUMBER
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 computed:

      assign launch__date = launch_date | date: '%d' | plus: 0
      ...
      {% raw %}{% if launch__date < 02 %}{% endraw %} "day" {% raw %}{% else %}{% endraw %} "days"

  `date: '%d'` is the DAY OF THE MONTH of the launch date — not the
  number of days remaining. So the label read "day" for any product
  launching on the 1st of a month, regardless of how far away it was,
  and "days" otherwise, including when exactly one day remained.

  The day count is filled in by JavaScript at runtime, so the label
  cannot be decided correctly in Liquid at all. Both forms are now
  emitted as data attributes for the countdown script to choose
  between, and the plural renders as the default.

  ACTION REQUIRED: the countdown JS lives in v3's theme.js (283 KB,
  not yet ported). When porting it, have it read data-label-day and
  data-label-days and swap the .separator text in .count-days.
  ==================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  unless cardProduct
    break
  endunless
  assign launch_date = cardProduct.metafields.theme.product_countdown.value
-%}

{%- if launch_date != blank -%}
  <div
    class="countdown-timer"
    data-countdown-timer
    data-launch-date="{{ launch_date }}"
    data-label-day="{{ 'sections.featured_collection.collection_countdown_day' | t }}"
    data-label-days="{{ 'sections.featured_collection.collection_countdown_days' | t }}"
    style="display: none;"
  >
    <div class="count-days">
      <span class="time days"></span>
      <span class="separator">{{ 'sections.featured_collection.collection_countdown_days' | t }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="count-hours">
      <span class="time hours"></span>
      <span class="separator">{{ 'general.countdown.hours' | t }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="count-minutes">
      <span class="time minutes"></span>
      <span class="separator">{{ 'general.countdown.minutes' | t }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="count-seconds">
      <span class="time seconds"></span>
      <span class="separator">{{ 'general.countdown.seconds' | t }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
